{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Give thanks to YHWH</b> — the redeemed of YHWH will say. The Sages, of blessed memory, said: four must give thanks, and they are those mentioned in the psalm. And the phrase <b>give thanks to YHWH</b> — the redeemed will say it; therefore after it they say: <b>from the hand of the foe</b>, like <b>I was in distress</b> [צר לי]."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 107, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:38:51.968123384Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}